Changes from upstream
=====================

Service worker console capture (new):
  - src/ServiceWorkerCollector.ts — new file
  - src/tools/serviceWorker.ts — new file
  - tests/tools/serviceWorker.test.ts — new file
  - src/McpContext.ts — modified to integrate ServiceWorkerCollector
  - src/tools/ToolDefinition.ts — modified with service worker methods
  - src/tools/tools.ts — modified to register service worker tools

Extension support enabled by default:
  - src/cli.ts — categoryExtensions default changed to true
  - src/browser.ts — strips --enable-automation when extensions enabled

Telemetry removed:
  - Google Clearcut telemetry code removed from src/main.ts
  - CLI options for usage statistics and clearcut removed from src/cli.ts
  - No telemetry or usage data is collected by this fork

Rebranded:
  - Project renamed from chrome-devtools-mcp to maxerviker-devtools-mcp
  - Server identity updated throughout
  - All new files carry BAM-DevCrew copyright
  - Original Google LLC copyright retained on unmodified upstream files
